<item><title>Cameroon opens coffee organisation to consumer countries</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-opens-coffee-organisation-to-consumer-countries-04e2ce/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-opens-coffee-organisation-to-consumer-countries-04e2ce/</guid><category>Cameroon</category><description>A revised framework lets African coffee-consuming countries seek membership and join producers in discussions on processing, marketing and sales.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 12:03:54 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cm.jpg" length="34085" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cm.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
